    end_line: 210
    content: "---\nname: TaskFlow Narrative\ncolors:\n  surface: \'#f8f9ff\'\n  surface-dim: \'#cbdbf5\'\n  surface-bright: \'#f8f9ff\'\n  surface-container-lowest: \'#ffffff\'\n  surface-container-low: \'#eff4ff\'\n  surface-container: \'#e5eeff\'\n  surface-container-high: \'#dce9ff\'\n  surface-container-highest: \'#d3e4fe\'\n  on-surface: \'#0b1c30\'\n  on-surface-variant: \'#434655\'\n  inverse-surface: \'#213145\'\n  inverse-on-surface: \'#eaf1ff\'\n  outline: \'#737686\'\n  outline-variant: \'#c3c6d7\'\n  surface-tint: \'#0053db\'\n  primary: \'#004ac6\'\n  on-primary: \'#ffffff\'\n  primary-container: \'#2563eb\'\n  on-primary-container: \'#eeefff\'\n  inverse-primary: \'#b4c5ff\'\n  secondary: \'#516070\'\n  on-secondary: \'#ffffff\'\n  secondary-container: \'#d5e4f8\'\n  on-secondary-container: \'#576676\'\n  tertiary: \'#006242\'\n  on-tertiary: \'#ffffff\'\n  tertiary-container: \'#007d55\'\n  on-tertiary-container: \'#bdffdb\'\n  error: \'#ba1a1a\'\n  on-error: \'#ffffff\'\n  error-container: \'#ffdad6\'\n  on-error-container: \'#93000a\'\n  primary-fixed: \'#dbe1ff\'\n  primary-fixed-dim: \'#b4c5ff\'\n  on-primary-fixed: \'#00174b\'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: \'#003ea8\'\n  secondary-fixed: \'#d5e4f8\'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: \'#b9c8db\'\n  on-secondary-fixed: \'#0e1d2b\'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: \'#3a4858\'\n  tertiary-fixed: \'#6ffbbe\'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: \'#4edea3\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: \'#002113\'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: \'#005236\'\n  background: \'#f8f9ff\'\n  on-background: \'#0b1c30\'\n  surface-variant: \'#d3e4fe\'\ntypography:\n  headline-xl:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 36px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 44px\n  headline-xl-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 28px\n    fontWeight: \'700\'\n    lineHeight: 36px\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n  headline-lg-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 20px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  headline-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 26px\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  body-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: \'400\'\n    lineHeight: 18px\n  label-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: \'500\'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 11px\n    fontWeight: \'600\'\n    lineHeight: 14px\n    letterSpacing: 0.04em\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.25rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\n  md: 0.75rem\n  lg: 1rem\n  xl: 1.5rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  gutter: 1.5rem\n  margin: 2rem\n  gutter-mobile: 0.75rem\n  margin-mobile: 1rem\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\n  space-md: 1rem\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\n  space-xl: 2rem\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\n\nThis design system embodies high-efficiency minimalism infused with an approachable, modern executive finish. Built for task-driven personal workflows, the interface eliminates cognitive clutter to induce focused productivity, clarity, and calm control. \n\nThe aesthetic is anchored in clean functionalism: abundant white space, refined micro-elevations, deliberate blue-spectrum accents, and crisp visual hierarchy. Interactions are swift and understated, offering tangible satisfaction through subtle state transformations without theatrical friction.\n\n## Colors\n\nThe palette establishes an airy, clean environment through a carefully calibrated cool spectrum:\n\n- **Primary (`#2563EB` / `#1D4ED8`):** Directs the user\'s immediate attention to key actions, current filters, and critical interface anchors.\n- **Secondary (`#EFF6FF` / `#DBEAFE`):** Serves as contextual highlighting, hover fills, active tab backgrounds, and selected card states.\n- **Success Accent (`#10B981`):** Celebrates completion events, task checkboxes, and progress indicators with an uplifting, crisp emerald tone.\n- **Destructive Accent (`#EF4444`):** Flags deletion thresholds, overdue indicators, and high-urgency alerts.\n- **Neutrals & Canvas:** \n  - Base canvas: `#FFFFFF` (Pure white for elevated cards and foreground containers).\n  - Background surface: `#F8FAFC` (Cool slate tint providing seamless contrast against pure white cards).\n  - Borders & Dividers: `#E2E8F0` (Whisper-thin, non-distracting containment lines).\n  - Text Hierarchy: `#0F172A` (Primary titles), `#334155` (Body text), `#64748B` (Metadata and helper labels).\n\n## Typography\n\nThe type system is unified through Plus Jakarta Sans, combining modern geometric legibility with gentle humanistic curves. \n\n- Use `headline-xl` and `headline-lg` exclusively for dashboard views, project headers, and view titles.\n- Set standard task titles with `body-lg` or `label-lg` depending on actionable priority.\n- Apply `label-sm` with upper-case styling and positive letter-spacing (`0.04em`) for metadata, deadlines, tag categories, and status indicators.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nThe layout is grounded in a fluid grid adapting from an expansive desktop dashboard to a compact, thumb-accessible mobile experience:\n\n- **Desktop (1024px+):** Fixed collapsible sidebar navigation (260px) paired with an 8-column main content grid (`gutter: 1.5rem`, `margin: 2rem`). Content max-width is constrained to `1200px` for optimal reading scan lines.\n- **Tablet (768px - 1023px):** Collapsed icon-based rail navigation, 6-column fluid canvas with `1.5rem` margins.\n- **Mobile (< 767px):** Full-bleed single-column layout, bottom persistent navigation bar, reduced outer margins (`1rem`), and tighter gutters (`0.75rem`).\n- **Vertical Rhythm:** Consistent multi-step scaling based on `0.25rem` intervals preserves visual balance between subtasks, metadata icons, and interactive rows.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nVisual hierarchy uses ambient micro-elevations, pristine boundaries, and low-contrast borders instead of heavy, opaque shadows:\n\n- **Level 0 (Base):** `#F8FAFC` flat surface for canvas backing and side panels.\n- **Level 1 (Card Rest):** `#FFFFFF` surface accompanied by a hairline border (`1px solid #E2E8F0`) and an ambient glow: `box-shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 1px 2px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04)`.\n- **Level 2 (Hover & Active Drag):** Slight elevation on pointer interaction: `box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04)`, accompanied by subtle border tinting (`#DBEAFE`).\n- **Level 3 (Modals & Overlays):** `box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04)` over a frosted, semi-transparent backdrop (`rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3)` with `backdrop-filter: blur(4px)`).\n\n## Shapes\n\nThe design uses balanced, rounded contours to soften functional data density:\n\n- Default buttons, input fields, checkboxes, and task tiles use `rounded` (0.5rem / 8px).\n- High-level containers, grouped project lists, and modal sheets adopt `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px) or `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px).\n- Category badges, status indicators, and avatar icons adopt full pill curvature (`9999px`) to separate metadata from rectangular interactive task blocks.\n\n## Components\n\n### Buttons\n- **Primary:** Solid `#2563EB` fill with `#FFFFFF` text. Hover shifts to `#1D4ED8`. Active state scales subtly (`scale: 0.98`). Focus-visible displays an external ring: `2px solid #FFFFFF, 2px solid #2563EB`.\n- **Secondary:** Surface `#EFF6FF` with text `#1D4ED8`. Hover shifts to `#DBEAFE`.\n- **Ghost/Tertiary:** Transparent fill, `#334155` text. Hover initiates `#F1F5F9` background.\n- **Destructive:** `#EF4444` background, `#FFFFFF` text. Used for irreversible actions.\n\n### Checkboxes (Task Completion)\n- Outer box: 20px x 20px with `rounded` (6px) geometry and `1.5px solid #CBD5E1` border.\n- Hover: Border shifts to `#2563EB`.\n- Checked: Transition to `#10B981` background and border, featuring an animated white checkmark glyph. Completed sibling task text automatically strikes through with `#64748B` color shift.\n\n### Input Fields & Quick-Add Bar\n- Canvas of `#FFFFFF`, `1px solid #E2E8F0` border, `0.5rem` internal padding.\n- Focused state eliminates generic outline in favor of a crisp `1px solid #2563EB` paired with an ambient ring: `0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)`.\n- Quick-add inputs feature integrated trailing action chips (due dates, priority flags) for rapid keyboard-first entry.\n\n### Cards & Task Rows\n- Independent task cards use a `#FFFFFF` fill with `1px solid #E2E8F0` framing.\n- Hover dynamically reveals secondary inline utilities (drag handle, delete, sub-actions) while slightly transitioning border color to `#CBD5E1`.\n- Selected/editing cards carry a faint left border accent (`3px solid #2563EB`).\n\n### Chips & Tags\n- Pill-shaped container (`border-radius: 9999px`) with padding `2px 8px`.\n- High priority: `#FEE2E2` fill with `#B91C1C` text.\n- Routine tag: `#F1F5F9` fill with `#475569` text.\n- Project category: `#EFF6FF` fill with `#1D4ED8` text.\n\n### Empty States & Dialogs\n- Centered layout, light monochromatic illustration with `#DBEAFE` and `#2563EB` lines, clear title in `headline-sm`, and an immediate primary call-to-action button."
    num_lines: 211
    num_bytes: 9256
    line_range_bytes: 9256
  }
}
