  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the UI component implementation. Starting with `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, the desktop version will be a fixed 260px wide sidebar that\'s collapsible. I\'m focusing on clean design and making sure it adheres to both the \"TaskFlow Narrative\" and my `frontend-design` notes. I\'m focusing on the `w-[260px]` size.\n\n\n**Refining UI Component Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Sidebar\'s responsive design. I\'m focusing on the different states for desktop (expanded and collapsed), tablet (compact icon rail), and mobile (persistent bottom navigation bar). The mobile version, in particular, will be a compact bottom bar with specific views. I\'m paying special attention to the visual details, such as border colors, numeric counts, and subtle project indicators.\n\n\n**Detailing TaskRow Component**\n\nI\'m now deep in the implementation of the `TaskRow` component. I\'m focusing on the individual elements and interactions. Specifically, I\'m working on the independent row style, the custom animated checkbox with its hover and checked states, and how completed task titles should appear. I\'m now implementing the metadata row below the title, including priority indicators, due date handling (overdue, today, and other), and project and subtask progress display.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "Szr_aoHFIa_6xs0P18e7gA0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_489778051930368761"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  BarChart3,\\n  CalendarDays,\\n  CheckSquare,\\n  ChevronLeft,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  FolderKanban,\\n  Inbox,\\n  Plus,\\n  Settings,\\n  Sun,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { NavView, Project, ProjectAccent, UserPreferences } from \'../types/taskflow\';\\n\\ninterface SidebarProps {\\n  activeView: NavView;\\n  selectedProjectId: string | null;\\n  onSelectView: (view: NavView, projectId?: string | null) => void;\\n  projects: Project[];\\n  counts: {\\n    today: number;\\n    upcoming: number;\\n    inbox: number;\\n    projects: Record<string, number>;\\n  };\\n  preferences: UserPreferences;\\n  onToggleCollapse: () => void;\\n  onOpenNewProject: () => void;\\n  onOpenSettings: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nconst ACCENT_DOT: Record<ProjectAccent, string> = {\\n  blue: \'bg-[#2563EB]\',\\n  indigo: \'bg-[#4F46E5]\',\\n  emerald: \'bg-[#10B981]\',\\n  slate: \'bg-[#64748B]\',\\n};\\n\\nexport const Sidebar: React.FC<SidebarProps> = ({\\n  activeView,\\n  selectedProjectId,\\n  onSelectView,\\n  projects,\\n  counts,\\n  preferences,\\n  onToggleCollapse,\\n  onOpenNewProject,\\n  onOpenSettings,\\n}) => {\\n  const collapsed = preferences.sidebarCollapsed;\\n  const initials = preferences.userName\\n    .split(\' \')\\n    .filter(Boolean)\\n    .slice(0, 2)\\n    .map((n) => n[0]?.toUpperCase())\\n    .join(\'\') || \'TF\';\\n\\n  const navItems: {\\n    id: NavView;\\n    label: string;\\n    icon: React.ReactNode;\\n    count?: number;\\n  }[] = [\\n    { id: \'today\', label: \'Today\', icon: <Sun className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />, count: counts.today },\\n    {\\n      id: \'upcoming\',\\n      label: \'Upcoming\',\\n      icon: <CalendarDays className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n      count: counts.upcoming,\\n    },\\n    { id: \'inbox\', label: \'Inbox\', icon: <Inbox className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />, count: counts.inbox },\\n    {\\n      id: \'projects\',\\n      label: \'Projects\',\\n      icon: <FolderKanban className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n      count: projects.length,\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'review\',\\n      label: \'Weekly Review\',\\n      icon: <BarChart3 className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      {/* Desktop & Tablet Sidebar */}\\n      <aside\\n        aria-label=\\\"Workspace navigation\\\"\\n        className={`hidden md:flex flex-col shrink-0 bg-[#FFFFFF] border-r border-[#E2E8F0] transition-[width] duration-200 ease-out select-none ${\\n          collapsed ? \'w-[72px]\' : \'w-[260px]\'\\n        }`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Brand Row */}\\n        <div\\n          className={`flex items-center h-16 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] ${\\n            collapsed ? \'justify-center px-3\' : \'justify-between px-5\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onSelectView(\'today\', null)}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none tf-focus-ring rounded-lg p-1 -ml-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-[#2563EB] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n              <CheckSquare className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" strokeWidth={2.25} />\\n            </div>\\n            {!collapsed && (\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0F172A] whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                TaskFlow\\n              </span>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {!collapsed && (\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onToggleCollapse}\\n              title=\\\"Collapse sidebar\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Collapse sidebar\\\"\\n              className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-md text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#0F172A] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] transition-colors tf-focus-ring\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {collapsed && (\\n          <div className=\\\"flex justify-center pt-3\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onToggleCollapse}\\n              title=\\\"Expand sidebar\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Expand sidebar\\\"\\n              className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded-md text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#0F172A] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] transition-colors tf-focus-ring\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        {/* Primary Views */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-3 py-4 space-y-6\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n            {!collapsed && (\\n              <div className=\\\"px-2.5 pb-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-[#64748B]\\\">\\n                Workspace\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n            {navItems.map((item) => {\\n              const isActive =\\n                activeView === item.id && (item.id !== \'projects\' || selectedProjectId === null);\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={item.id}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => onSelectView(item.id, null)}\\n                  title={collapsed ? item.label : undefined}\\n                  className={`w-full flex items-center ${\\n                    collapsed ? \'justify-center px-2\' : \'justify-between px-2.5\'\\n                  } h-10 rounded-lg text-[14px] font-medium transition-colors tf-focus-ring ${\\n                    isActive\\n                      ? \'bg-[#EFF6FF] text-[#1D4ED8] font-semibold\'\\n                      : \'text-[#334155] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] hover:text-[#0F172A]\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                    <span className={isActive ? \'text-[#2563EB]\' : \'text-[#64748B]\'}>\\n                      {item.icon}\\n                    </span>\\n                    {!collapsed && <span className=\\\"truncate whitespace-nowrap\\\">{item.label}</span>}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {!collapsed && item.count !== undefined && (\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`text-[12px] tabular-nums ml-2 ${\\n                        isActive ? \'text-[#1D4ED8] font-semibold\' : \'text-[#64748B]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {item.count}\\n                    </span>\\n                  )}\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Projects Section */}\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n            {!collapsed ? (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 pb-1.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-[#64748B]\\\">\\n                  Projects\\n                </span>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={onOpenNewProject}\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Create new project\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"New project\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"p-1 rounded text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#2563EB] hover:bg-[#EFF6FF] transition-colors tf-focus-ring\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            ) : (\\n              <div className=\\\"border-t border-[#E2E8F0] pt-3 flex justify-center\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={onOpenNewProject}\\n                  aria-label=\\\"Create new project\\\"\\n                  title=\\\"New project\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"p-2 rounded-lg text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#2563EB] hover:bg-[#EFF6FF] transition-colors tf-focus-ring\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <Plus className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n\\n            {projects.map((project) => {\\n              const isSelected =\\n                activeView === \'projects\' && selectedProjectId === project.id;\\n              const remaining = counts.projects[project.id] ?? 0;\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={project.id}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => onSelectView(\'projects\', project.id)}\\n                  title={collapsed ? project.name : undefined}\\n                  className={`w-full flex items-center ${\\n                    collapsed ? \'justify-center px-2\' : \'justify-between px-2.5\'\\n                  } h-9 rounded-lg text-[14px] transition-colors tf-focus-ring ${\\n                    isSelected\\n                      ? \'bg-[#EFF6FF] text-[#1D4ED8] font-semibold\'\\n                      : \'text-[#334155] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] hover:text-[#0F172A]\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                    <span\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className={`w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0 ${ACCENT_DOT[project.accent]}`}\\n                    />\\n                    {!collapsed && <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{project.name}</span>}\\n                  </span>\\n                  {!collapsed && (\\n                    <span\\n                      className={`text-[12px] tabular-nums ml-2 ${\\n                        isSelected ? \'text-[#1D4ED8] font-semibold\' : \'text-[#64748B]\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {remaining}\\n                    </span>\\n                  )}\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Footer Profile / Settings */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-3 border-t border-[#E2E8F0]\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onOpenSettings}\\n            title={collapsed ? `${preferences.userName} \342\200\224 Preferences` : \'Workspace preferences\'}\\n            className={`w-full flex items-center ${\\n              collapsed ? \'justify-center p-1.5\' : \'justify-between px-2.5 py-2\'\\n            } rounded-lg hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] transition-colors tf-focus-ring`}\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#DBEAFE] text-[#1D4ED8] text-[12px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\\\">\\n                {initials}\\n              </div>\\n              {!collapsed && (\\n                <div className=\\\"min-w-0 text-left\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A] truncate\\\">\\n                    {preferences.userName}\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B] truncate\\\">{preferences.userRole}</div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n            {!collapsed && <Settings className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-[#64748B] shrink-0\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      {/* Mobile Persistent Bottom Navigation Bar (compact <= 60px) */}\\n      <nav\\n        aria-label=\\\"Mobile navigation\\\"\\n        className=\\\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 z-30 bg-[#FFFFFF]/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-[#E2E8F0] px-2 py-1.5 flex items-center justify-around\\\"\\n      >\\n        {[\\n          { id: \'today\' as NavView, label: \'Today\', icon: <Sun className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" /> },\\n          {\\n            id: \'upcoming\' as NavView,\\n            label: \'Upcoming\',\\n            icon: <CalendarDays className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n          },\\n          { id: \'inbox\' as NavView, label: \'Inbox\', icon: <Inbox className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" /> },\\n          {\\n            id: \'projects\' as NavView,\\n            label: \'Projects\',\\n            icon: <FolderKanban className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n          },\\n          {\\n            id: \'review\' as NavView,\\n            label: \'Review\',\\n            icon: <BarChart3 className=\\\"w-[18px] h-[18px]\\\" />,\\n          },\\n        ].map((item) => {\\n          const isActive = activeView === item.id;\\n          return (\\n            <button\\n              key={item.id}\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => onSelectView(item.id, null)}\\n              className={`flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-w-[56px] min-h-[44px] rounded-lg px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors ${\\n                isActive ? \'text-[#2563EB] bg-[#EFF6FF]\' : \'text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#0F172A]\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              {item.icon}\\n              <span className=\\\"mt-0.5 whitespace-nowrap\\\">{item.label}</span>\\n            </button>\\n          );\\n        })}\\n      </nav>\\n    </>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create Sidebar component with desktop collapsible rail, tablet icon rail, and mobile bottom navigation bar\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Sidebar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating Sidebar navigation component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create src/components/Sidebar.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\305\032\n\302\032\001i\024}\023A\345\243\311\251O.\365\371\261\345\366\355UU\234\021\351\bf*\342\aD1\304nC\334\227`\324\003\333\2769;h\276\3776+\233\377?\215B\334\341\257M\'\3415W \272\375\371\373\244Z5\243E\231\235H6\276\020nM\252\341s-Q\345\275\255k&u\364\254a\362\305\026*E#\177+\266#\3363\321\266};1\370\321&\210\371,\0253\023\'fd\a\212e;\314\253\032\221\216\311\273S\256x\201\337\271\214\024&\r\276\211\002_l\t\037\3471\210\240x\210\244\317b\375\3232\t]\344\257\347\226\365\231 \aVq\232\t`#y+\276\303\313dv\246\001\333\257\016\035Pn\373b\001\242\331\214\202\352\300\362\222\030!\364\217p$\347K$\332WlZ\213/\256\202\177\313\b;\215\201\355\300xQ\246R\340J\036\277Q\213\364\311\223\023\222\304W\306n\230\252\316\221\375gd\017\005\342\027\256\301\224\264N\206\272~s\350\037d\245\315\302*a\313\371\347\304\370F\216\234\270\257\261)\223\356\266\213\253\266\334C\215t0\245J\203Z}\243\374\002l\375\317\2640A\263\356\336\342\256\331\002?\277\337\271\260\022&\201\313\212\'\275<\276\006\v\b\vNF\r\005}g\315\321\223\251X\003\257\353=[\360\216\263o\221\b\273\250\251^\032\024\245`2\2747d1\277\304\265\037\254\214\032\206(c\253\027&\267\"<\234\266\210\364_(\006\020\212\030\277\337\243>4\350\313\347w\234\3608\276B\v\317\a\220\260\310uA\222\3043N\345\325`9\354!\377P1\273\326Sm\375{\243KB\302q*\355\2654\313\237\304\244\022GJ\306\371\241\305\224\353\334\2124\267\375A\332(\334\226\256<w\032(h\'\337\245\024\357\321zg\035\366\352\330O#\362\253\2232\230\222\331\337w\320\204]\255\313\250\223J\240|U\035J\377\370$\350pZ\371\344\213\212\336\2669\344k\3375\304@\352\275p\363\f\371B\303\200tG;\201\337w\304j\231\377\304\350\362\234\000\267$\2631R\231N\0300mC\340JB\237.\254h\006\207t4\r\255\272\a\273#0\314\201\257\332\332&9u\334\245\3621\224\325E\365\227w\227\321Q=\2043\rd\vI\315\320\301\371\004\330\355v\\gR7`\v\r\221\f<\001YJ\221\262\307C\364>\335\2460\026\273/u\035\363\005\021\354mV\313\277\276\304\326\314\b\235\342\360\274\231z\325\233\331\262\271\364$F\324Vyz<\031\354cI\25